## RESSOURCES ET DOCUMENTATION

### SQL Server
- Microsoft SQL Server Documentation
- T-SQL Reference
- SQL Server Management Studio (SSMS) Guide

### Node.js et Express
- Node.js Official Documentation
- Express.js Guide
- TypeScript Handbook

### Electron
- Electron Official Documentation
- Electron Builder Documentation
- Electron IPC Guide

### Angular
- Angular Official Documentation
- Angular Material Design Components
- RxJS Documentation

### Outils Recommandés
- IDE : Visual Studio Code
- Extensions VS Code : Docker, Remote - Containers, ESLint, Prettier
- Client SQL : Azure Data Studio, DBeaver
- API Testing : Postman, Insomnia
- Git GUI : GitKraken, SourceTree
- Design : Figma, Adobe XD (pour maquettes)

### Bibliothèques Utiles
- Backend : Winston (logging), Joi (validation), Jest (tests)
- Frontend : Chart.js (graphiques), date-fns (manipulation dates), lodash (utilitaires)

